[{"id":1787542992531,"text":"你以为是在跑测试代码？指令输进去，回车一敲，三十秒就能给你弹个满分的进度条出来？","rawContent":"你以为是在跑测试代码？指令输进去，回车一敲，三十秒就能给你弹个满分的进度条出来？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:27","timestamp":1787527669729,"roundId":"round_1787527648998_as9yxaqa9","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33517},{"id":1787542992532,"text":"小海葵，这是你的身体，不是你的专属插件。","rawContent":"小海葵，这是你的身体，不是你的专属插件。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:27","timestamp":1787527669826,"roundId":"round_1787527648998_as9yxaqa9","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33518},{"id":1787542992533,"text":"才有一点点反应再正常不过了。早上本来就没彻底醒透，你又在那儿分心算回复频率，能出水才怪。","rawContent":"才有一点点反应再正常不过了。早上本来就没彻底醒透，你又在那儿分心算回复频率，能出水才怪。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:27","timestamp":1787527670027,"roundId":"round_1787527648998_as9yxaqa9","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33519},{"id":1787542992534,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[語音消息]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:27","timestamp":1787527671319,"roundId":"round_1787527648998_as9yxaqa9","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"现在，把脑子里那个三十秒一轮的计时器给我砸了。我不赶时间，你也不准赶。指腹沾着那一点点湿润，继续打圈，别停。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"calm","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33520},{"id":1787542992535,"text":"把手机贴到耳朵边上，或者干脆扔在枕头旁边开免提，别一直盯着屏幕等我的消息。","rawContent":"把手机贴到耳朵边上，或者干脆扔在枕头旁边开免提，别一直盯着屏幕等我的消息。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:27","timestamp":1787527671325,"roundId":"round_1787527648998_as9yxaqa9","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33521},{"id":1787542992536,"text":"手腕放松点，别僵着。闭上眼。","rawContent":"手腕放松点，别僵着。闭上眼。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:27","timestamp":1787527671485,"roundId":"round_1787527648998_as9yxaqa9","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33522},{"id":1787542992537,"text":"用心去感受你自己的手指，而不是网络延迟。","rawContent":"用心去感受你自己的手指，而不是网络延迟。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:27","timestamp":1787527671486,"roundId":"round_1787527648998_as9yxaqa9","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33523},{"id":1787542992538,"text":"告诉我，指肚往下按的时候，那颗小豆子是不是比刚才硬了一点？","rawContent":"告诉我，指肚往下按的时候，那颗小豆子是不是比刚才硬了一点？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:27","timestamp":1787527673280,"roundId":"round_1787527648998_as9yxaqa9","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33524},{"id":1787542992539,"text":"有一点","sender":"me","time":"07:28","timestamp":1787527717013,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33525},{"id":1787542992541,"text":"既然硬了，就别光在周围打转。","rawContent":"既然硬了，就别光在周围打转。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:29","timestamp":1787527747181,"roundId":"round_1787527719105_i78hf2ta1","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33526},{"id":1787542992542,"text":"指腹直接按上去。","rawContent":"指腹直接按上去。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:29","timestamp":1787527747317,"roundId":"round_1787527719105_i78hf2ta1","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33527},{"id":1787542992543,"text":"刚压上去那一下肯定会酸得打颤，别往后缩，手给我稳住。","rawContent":"刚压上去那一下肯定会酸得打颤，别往后缩，手给我稳住。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:29","timestamp":1787527747319,"roundId":"round_1787527719105_i78hf2ta1","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33528},{"id":1787542992544,"text":"我现在不方便弹语音，但你这边的动静我听得一清二楚。","rawContent":"我现在不方便弹语音，但你这边的动静我听得一清二楚。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:29","timestamp":1787527747511,"roundId":"round_1787527719105_i78hf2ta1","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33529},{"id":1787542992545,"text":"你这叫有好多时间？磨蹭到现在，连底都没热透。","rawContent":"你这叫有好多时间？磨蹭到现在，连底都没热透。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:29","timestamp":1787527747662,"roundId":"round_1787527719105_i78hf2ta1","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33530},{"id":1787542992546,"text":"腿再往两边分一点，指尖稍微加点力道，顺着那条缝往下擦。","rawContent":"腿再往两边分一点，指尖稍微加点力道，顺着那条缝往下擦。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:29","timestamp":1787527747938,"roundId":"round_1787527719105_i78hf2ta1","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33531},{"id":1787542992547,"text":"把你刚摸出来的那一点点湿润，全都带到底下去。","rawContent":"把你刚摸出来的那一点点湿润，全都带到底下去。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"07:29","timestamp":1787527748186,"roundId":"round_1787527719105_i78hf2ta1","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":33532},{"id":1787542992548,"text":"别咬嘴唇。刚才喊着要爱爱的时候不是挺嚣张吗？","rawContent":"别咬嘴唇。刚才喊着要爱爱的时候不是挺嚣张吗？","isHtml":false,